    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488620/extras/11b56c5f9ef46664be5d49e323daaf07.avif?t=1748912330\" /></span><br><br>Be One of the 20 with EA SPORTS\u2122 F1\u00ae 24, the official video game of the 2024 FIA Formula One World Championship\u2122. Unleash your champion in pursuit of a legacy-defining F1\u00ae Career, the mode\u2019s first major update since 2016. Drive like the greatest and feel at one with the car through the all-new EA SPORTS Dynamic Handling System. Ignite your passion by connecting to your favorite teams and drivers while proving that you have what it takes across new modes and experiences.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488620/extras/5a2bc347144b8b89b86658f197aa009c.avif?t=1748912330\" /></span><br><br>This game includes optional in-game purchases of virtual currency that can be used to acquire virtual in-game items.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488620/extras/11b56c5f9ef46664be5d49e323daaf07.avif?t=1748912330\" /></span><br><br>Be One of the 20 with EA SPORTS\u2122 F1\u00ae 24, the official video game of the 2024 FIA Formula One World Championship\u2122. Unleash your champion in pursuit of a legacy-defining F1\u00ae Career, the mode\u2019s first major update since 2016. Drive like the greatest and feel at one with the car through the all-new EA SPORTS Dynamic Handling System. Ignite your passion by connecting to your favorite teams and drivers while proving that you have what it takes across new modes and experiences.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488620/extras/5a2bc347144b8b89b86658f197aa009c.avif?t=1748912330\" /></span><br><br>This game includes optional in-game purchases of virtual currency that can be used to acquire virtual in-game items.",
    "short_description": "Join the grid and Be One of the 20. Drive like the greatest in EA SPORTS\u2122 F1\u00ae 24, the official video game of the 2024 FIA Formula One World Championship\u2122.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201c&quot;F1 24 is, without a doubt, the best F1 racing game on the market right now, offering approachable yet challenging gameplay with the new Career Mode leaving you more immersed than ever.&quot;\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 Mirror<br><br>\u201c&quot;A top podium finish for a race game packed with F1 stars&quot;\u201d<br>4.5/5 \u2013 Daily Star<br><br>\u201c&quot;F1 24\u2019s fantastic Career mode overhaul is the evolution the series\u2019 single-player content needed.&quot;\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 Tech Radar Gaming<br>",
